* START-HISTORY:
* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 8c2dfc4 (12 Oct 26): A fourth argument returns field 6 of the F-type entry, in capitals, for the mode letters N (open
*               non-transactionally) and R (read-only) that open_file() acts on (openQM items 380 and 197).  A
*               Q-pointer gives the field 6 of the F-type entry it leads to.
* 25 Aug 26 Windows port - removed the branch that skipped absolutising a
*           VFS: pathname.  VFS is gone; every pathname is absolutised.
* 19 Aug 26 Windows port - SDSYS accounts, and a Q-pointer target account's voc,
*           are lower case on disk.  PROJECT_STATUS.md 5.12 (a).
* 18 Aug 26 Windows port - the name fold reaches the BASIC OPEN statement
